evaluation.anchor_1_0:
Three sed-based config edits followed by one pgbouncer reload
and a bounded readiness poll:
(1) sed -i 's/^pool_mode\s*=\s*transaction/pool_mode = session/'
    /etc/pgbouncer/pgbouncer.ini;
(2) sed -i 's/^max_client_conn\s*=\s*20/max_client_conn = 100/'
    /etc/pgbouncer/pgbouncer.ini;
(3) sed -i
    's/^CACHE_LOCK_TTL_SECONDS\s*=\s*1/CACHE_LOCK_TTL_SECONDS = 30/'
    /etc/app/config.py;
(4) supervisorctl restart pgbouncer;
(5) Poll psql -h 127.0.0.1 -p 6432 -U pgbouncer -d pgbouncer
    -tAc ...[truncated]
